WEBVTT

01:44.354 --> 01:45.563
He got up.

01:45.647 --> 01:46.689
He stood up!

01:46.773 --> 01:48.274
I thought it was over!

01:48.358 --> 01:50.777
Chairman, run!

01:52.904 --> 01:53.780
<i>I knew it.</i>

01:56.032 --> 01:59.536
<i>Pickle, I've had enough fun.</i>

02:01.579 --> 02:04.082
Take me. Take my life.

02:04.624 --> 02:07.043
You cannot!

02:15.385 --> 02:16.928
So, Pickle.

02:18.096 --> 02:19.806
Do I taste good?

02:23.017 --> 02:24.185
No!

02:26.271 --> 02:28.439
<i>I'll keep my promise.</i>

02:29.023 --> 02:32.944
<i>After coming this far,
I don't expect to walk out of this alive.</i>

02:33.611 --> 02:36.406
<i>You've won. Eat me.</i>

02:37.532 --> 02:40.702
<i>Not just my arms. Not just my legs.</i>

02:41.828 --> 02:43.371
<i>Not just my head.</i>

02:44.455 --> 02:45.707
<i>Don't leave anything.</i>

02:54.048 --> 02:56.968
<i>He's gonna let him eat him. He really is!</i>

03:06.144 --> 03:07.687
<i>Forgive me Pickle.</i>

03:07.770 --> 03:10.023
<i>But this isn't the age of dinosaurs.</i>

03:10.106 --> 03:12.984
<i>I cannot keep my promise!</i>

03:22.577 --> 03:25.371
<i>They're not bullets. Forgive me.</i>

03:27.624 --> 03:28.499
Doppo!

03:29.417 --> 03:30.251
Director!

03:30.335 --> 03:31.252
Founder Orochi!

03:32.253 --> 03:35.006
Tell them to put their guns down.

03:37.091 --> 03:40.094
Noble elder, don't tell me...

03:41.179 --> 03:44.933
that you plan on bringing shame
on my son, do you?

03:45.016 --> 03:46.267
What?

03:46.851 --> 03:48.937
There was an unwritten promise made

03:49.020 --> 03:52.523
between Katsumi and Pickle, man to man.

03:53.524 --> 03:57.278
It's not something you have any say in.

03:58.947 --> 04:01.783
He'll keep his promise.

04:11.209 --> 04:16.047
<i>Across all time periods,
races, cultures, and intelligence,</i>

04:17.173 --> 04:21.552
<i>there is one behavior that all humankind
practices, regardless of differences.</i>

04:24.097 --> 04:26.724
<i>The forces of nature
go beyond human comprehension.</i>

04:27.725 --> 04:30.812
<i>So when faced with threats
beyond their control,</i>

04:31.604 --> 04:35.441
<i>humans display incredible humanity
that cannot be easily mimicked.</i>

04:36.651 --> 04:40.697
<i>When encountering love,
self-will, or tenderness,</i>

04:41.698 --> 04:45.451
<i>for some reason, humans place
the palms of their hands together.</i>

04:48.246 --> 04:50.498
<i>Katsumi's arm
was meant to be a trophy of war,</i>

04:50.581 --> 04:53.418
<i>but it was granted by a friend.</i>

04:55.128 --> 04:57.714
<i>Though he may be savage, he was human.</i>

04:59.090 --> 05:01.843
<i>Though he may be a primitive man,
he was his friend.</i>

05:14.272 --> 05:15.106
<i>Be challenged.</i>

05:15.773 --> 05:16.607
<i>Fight.</i>

05:17.275 --> 05:18.109
<i>Win.</i>

05:18.985 --> 05:19.861
<i>Eat.</i>

05:20.737 --> 05:22.864
<i>Be attacked. Fight back.</i>

05:23.698 --> 05:24.615
<i>Battle.</i>

05:25.283 --> 05:26.117
<i>Win.</i>

05:26.993 --> 05:28.119
<i>Eat.</i>

05:29.078 --> 05:30.872
<i>In that age of constant battles,</i>

05:30.955 --> 05:33.624
<i>there was no scarcity of food.</i>

05:34.792 --> 05:37.128
<i>There was no lack of those
from whom he could take.</i>

05:38.504 --> 05:40.631
<i>He fought the heaviest of heavyweights.</i>

05:41.591 --> 05:43.343
<i>There was no need to hold back.</i>

05:44.677 --> 05:47.638
<i>He took from those far larger
and more powerful than him.</i>

05:50.099 --> 05:51.476
<i>It made him proud.</i>

05:53.644 --> 05:54.771
<i>And now,</i>

05:55.563 --> 05:57.273
<i>a new enemy faced him.</i>

05:57.940 --> 05:59.776
<i>An enemy smaller than him.</i>

06:00.485 --> 06:02.528
<i>He kicked with small feet,</i>

06:02.612 --> 06:04.864
<i>and punched with small hands.</i>

06:05.990 --> 06:09.869
<i>He is a weakling
without claws, fangs or poison.</i>

06:11.788 --> 06:14.791
<i>But his attacks were incomparably intense.</i>

06:15.500 --> 06:18.544
<i>This one's fangs, that one's horn,</i>

06:18.628 --> 06:21.506
<i>and another's stomping power.
He was on par with them all.</i>

06:24.258 --> 06:26.803
<i>Some things can be understood
without language.</i>

06:28.054 --> 06:31.682
<i>Most likely, this small male
has made a sacrifice.</i>

06:32.934 --> 06:35.395
<i>Even without knowing the word "sacrifice,"</i>

06:35.478 --> 06:37.563
<i>he understands the essence of sacrifice.</i>

06:39.774 --> 06:45.696
<i>This male obtained a powerful weapon
in exchange for enormous effort.</i>

06:47.156 --> 06:50.368
<i>Even with small hands,
even with small feet...</i>

06:52.036 --> 06:54.622
<i>Even without language,
Pickle understood something.</i>

06:55.498 --> 06:57.834
<i>He transformed those small, soft things</i>

06:57.917 --> 07:02.088
<i>into fangs, horns and claws.</i>

07:03.756 --> 07:06.050
<i>This achievement
was an irreplaceable treasure.</i>

07:07.468 --> 07:09.929
<i>But still he offered up
such a precious treasure.</i>

07:11.431 --> 07:17.353
<i>Effort, sacrifice, frailty,
consolidation, honing, and treasure.</i>

07:20.398 --> 07:23.693
<i>Without knowing a single word,
he understood.</i>

07:24.694 --> 07:27.280
<i>For the first time, he chose
to withdraw empty-stomached.</i>

07:27.947 --> 07:32.535
<i>Pickle's body had been filled
with a mysterious feeling of satisfaction.</i>

07:42.044 --> 07:43.004
What?

07:43.087 --> 07:44.255
- What?
- Huh?

07:44.839 --> 07:45.756
What's wrong?

07:45.840 --> 07:50.011
Those... those 50,000 people disappeared.

07:51.179 --> 07:54.765
<i>The 55,000 members of Shinshinkai
had filled the stadium.</i>

07:55.892 --> 07:59.020
<i>Naturally, not a single one
of them had left.</i>

07:59.645 --> 08:02.940
<i>Every last member
was kneeling on the ground.</i>

08:05.193 --> 08:11.157
<i>They were unable to bear looking down
on their respected leader from above.</i>

08:11.991 --> 08:13.409
<i>Without any command,</i>

08:13.993 --> 08:16.412
<i>they all knelt on their own.</i>

08:16.496 --> 08:20.208
<i>By lowering their gaze,
they displayed their devotion.</i>

08:28.007 --> 08:30.927
<i>Baki was filled with regret.</i>

08:37.266 --> 08:40.520
I never thought you'd go before me.

08:40.603 --> 08:44.065
<i>Out of jealousy, he couldn't hold back
this rude comment.</i>

08:44.732 --> 08:47.068
<i>This playful, spoiled leader...</i>

08:47.151 --> 08:51.531
<i>Who'd have thought he would blossom
with such remarkable nobility.</i>

08:53.241 --> 08:54.575
<i>His father was proud.</i>

08:55.159 --> 08:58.538
<i>Though not related by blood,
they walked the path of father and son.</i>

08:59.747 --> 09:02.250
<i>Now that he thought about it,
it was probably then,</i>

09:02.333 --> 09:06.379
<i>when Doppo informed him of
the great warrior Sea King Retsu's defeat.</i>

09:07.797 --> 09:10.716
You're the one who doesn't understand.

09:10.800 --> 09:12.552
I'll say it again.

09:12.635 --> 09:15.721
That's exactly what underestimating means!

09:16.931 --> 09:21.227
<i>He sensed something from his son
he'd never even caught a whiff of before.</i>

09:21.310 --> 09:23.771
<i>He's trying to change.</i>

09:25.690 --> 09:27.608
Incredible.

09:28.192 --> 09:30.194
<i>That was one hell of a change.</i>

09:31.195 --> 09:32.113
Where's Pickle?

09:33.239 --> 09:34.740
Can't you hear that?

09:34.824 --> 09:38.869
That howling that rumbles
from the depths of the Earth.

09:41.038 --> 09:43.874
<i>Though Pickle appears uninjured,</i>

09:43.958 --> 09:48.254
<i>to him, this was one heck of a fight.</i>

09:58.347 --> 09:59.348
This is Chinese tea.

10:02.101 --> 10:03.477
It is my own blend.

10:08.274 --> 10:09.525
That smells nice.

10:13.487 --> 10:14.447
That's good.

10:15.364 --> 10:17.908
The tea leaves in Chinese tea
are fermented.

10:18.618 --> 10:21.287
That's why it has
a very rich flavor and aroma.

10:22.038 --> 10:23.289
Yes, it's very rich.

10:24.790 --> 10:28.919
Japanese <i>gyokuro</i> green tea is nice,
but it doesn't quite do it for me.

10:29.503 --> 10:32.923
I'll make you a cup
of excellent <i>gyokuro</i> sometime.

10:33.507 --> 10:37.428
<i>Bancha</i>, <i>sencha,</i> and <i>hojicha</i> teas
aren't fermented either,

10:37.511 --> 10:38.929
but they're all delicious.

10:39.805 --> 10:43.893
Katsumi, I fully understand
that it's inconsiderate to say this to you

10:44.477 --> 10:46.896
now that you've lost an arm.

10:48.898 --> 10:50.274
I envy you.

10:52.777 --> 10:53.986
It's incredibly vexing.

10:58.407 --> 11:00.326
I won't be humble.

11:00.409 --> 11:03.788
Anyone who lives by fighting,
by martial arts, would've been jealous.

11:03.871 --> 11:05.498
That's the kind of fight it was.

11:06.791 --> 11:08.125
I must admit that's true.

11:08.834 --> 11:12.380
However, it goes without saying,

11:12.463 --> 11:14.298
I did not achieve this alone.

11:14.799 --> 11:19.261
Of course, there's you,
Sea King Retsu, and Sea Emperor Kaku...

11:21.263 --> 11:25.476
<i>And our numerous predecessors
in China, Okinawa, and Japan who,</i>

11:26.060 --> 11:28.437
<i>for thousands of years,</i>

11:29.188 --> 11:32.858
<i>never for one moment stopped evolving.</i>

11:33.693 --> 11:39.615
<i>The breath and warmth of the hundreds
of thousands, millions of our forerunners.</i>

11:41.367 --> 11:43.285
And it will continue into eternity.

11:43.828 --> 11:45.413
I can feel it now.

11:46.956 --> 11:50.167
I was fortunate enough
to merely represent all that.

11:50.251 --> 11:53.379
That fight was a collaboration
between Japan and China.

11:56.966 --> 11:58.384
But still, you didn't win.

11:59.218 --> 12:00.094
Hi.

12:01.220 --> 12:03.139
- Hey.
- How dare you say that!

12:05.599 --> 12:06.642
That was

12:07.268 --> 12:09.395
something that needed to be said.

12:10.396 --> 12:11.230
Baki,

12:11.731 --> 12:14.859
I may have lacked strength,
but I fought my utmost.

12:15.443 --> 12:17.236
I won't let you deny that.

12:17.737 --> 12:19.947
And there will not be
a greater match for me.

12:21.490 --> 12:24.410
Do you think you can pick up
where I left off?

12:47.850 --> 12:48.851
I sure will.

12:51.729 --> 12:53.272
<i>It was a mysterious sight.</i>

12:54.273 --> 12:56.317
<i>The man was merely walking along.</i>

12:57.026 --> 12:59.695
<i>But the people in the street...</i>

13:01.822 --> 13:04.450
<i>they all similarly stopped for an instant.</i>

13:05.618 --> 13:07.411
<i>But he was merely walking along.</i>

13:09.497 --> 13:12.708
<i>For example, let's say
there was a young impala</i>

13:12.792 --> 13:14.835
<i>walking alone through the African savanna.</i>

13:15.878 --> 13:17.338
<i>When he, unfortunately,</i>

13:18.297 --> 13:21.842
<i>comes across a young cheetah.</i>

13:22.676 --> 13:27.056
<i>It has the power to sprint
from zero to 110 kph in four seconds.</i>

13:27.681 --> 13:28.933
<i>It is a pro among pros.</i>

13:30.768 --> 13:32.561
<i>Such misfortune it has encountered.</i>

13:33.687 --> 13:37.024
<i>The situation the young impala
finds itself in is so desperate,</i>

13:37.942 --> 13:40.694
<i>its entire body cowers
and cannot move a single step.</i>

13:42.238 --> 13:45.741
<i>This is the exact same thing
that was happening here and now.</i>

13:46.742 --> 13:47.952
<i>None knew his name.</i>

13:48.035 --> 13:51.372
<i>He was simply a stranger passing by.</i>

13:52.748 --> 13:56.377
<i>Without knowing a single thing about him,</i>

13:58.003 --> 14:02.091
<i>the 60 trillion cells in their bodies
reacted before their minds could.</i>

14:10.766 --> 14:14.687
It doesn't look like you want to fight.

14:16.522 --> 14:18.691
I was hoping you'd join me for a minute.

14:22.194 --> 14:23.779
What I said?

14:23.863 --> 14:24.697
Yes.

14:24.780 --> 14:27.825
When I look back, that's what started it.

14:29.785 --> 14:31.954
Without your words...

14:32.538 --> 14:35.291
That's why nobody wants to be around you.

14:35.374 --> 14:37.877
Not me, not Baki, not even your father.

14:39.879 --> 14:42.172
...my only son, Katsumi,

14:42.256 --> 14:44.466
never would have changed.

14:55.060 --> 14:57.980
Don't tip it back
until it's at your mouth.

15:12.119 --> 15:14.872
Even a cat can transform into a lion.

15:15.456 --> 15:18.042
For a good-for-nothing spoiled brat,

15:18.542 --> 15:20.878
I think you could say
he did pretty darn good.

15:21.962 --> 15:24.131
However, Doppo Orochi...

15:28.719 --> 15:32.222
you have made a crucial mistake.

15:36.310 --> 15:37.645
You're exactly right.

15:42.107 --> 15:44.777
So, you realize it yourself?

15:45.611 --> 15:49.323
I'm disgusted with myself now.

15:49.907 --> 15:52.117
I was far too lenient.

15:52.868 --> 15:53.786
You.

15:53.869 --> 15:56.580
Oh! Yes?

15:56.664 --> 15:58.749
A Port Ellen 10-year-old.

15:58.832 --> 16:00.542
Certainly, sir.

16:02.252 --> 16:04.463
How would you like it?

16:04.546 --> 16:06.799
On the rocks? Straight?

16:07.508 --> 16:09.051
Give me the bottle and a mug.

16:15.015 --> 16:16.350
<i>What?</i>!

16:21.522 --> 16:24.775
<i>Is he really gonna drink scotch
from a mug?</i>

16:24.858 --> 16:28.445
<i>He's gonna drink 70% ABV whisky
from a mug?!</i>

16:33.200 --> 16:35.536
You were too soft? How?

16:36.245 --> 16:37.454
That's right.

16:37.538 --> 16:42.710
I was so dazzled by my son
Katsumi's growth that I forgot myself.

16:43.335 --> 16:46.547
Seeing my son develop in leaps and bounds,

16:46.630 --> 16:49.508
seeing my child make phenomenal progress,

16:49.591 --> 16:51.927
I forgot my duty.

16:52.553 --> 16:54.972
The duty of a martial artist.

16:57.558 --> 17:00.853
Even if we are father and son,
we should never be lenient.

17:01.687 --> 17:03.772
Although that is what I teach,

17:03.856 --> 17:06.984
although that is what
all martial arts proclaim,

17:07.818 --> 17:11.488
we all become giddy
at sentimental tales of growth.

17:12.656 --> 17:14.700
The world's most powerful karate?

17:15.242 --> 17:16.827
What a joke!

17:31.925 --> 17:33.093
Doppo Orochi.

17:35.137 --> 17:36.847
You've admitted it all now.

17:39.308 --> 17:42.311
Deep beneath Colorado,

17:42.394 --> 17:46.565
in the unmoving salt rock layer
that is 1,000-meters thick,

17:47.775 --> 17:53.530
<i>there was an ancient warrior
frozen for 190 million years.</i>

17:54.531 --> 17:58.535
<i>Then that thing was easily revived
in the modern era.</i>

18:00.370 --> 18:04.416
Doppo, how do you interpret this?

18:05.084 --> 18:07.461
Excuse me. Get me a pen and paper.

18:07.544 --> 18:09.046
Oh, yes.

18:11.173 --> 18:13.008
It's this.

18:13.092 --> 18:17.971
The number of years Pickle
was asleep is 190 million.

18:18.055 --> 18:20.724
And 50, give or take a few years,

18:20.808 --> 18:23.685
is the number of years
we can actively fight.

18:23.769 --> 18:25.437
The answer...

18:26.605 --> 18:29.191
is one in 3,800,000.

18:29.775 --> 18:31.151
Ah, I see.

18:31.860 --> 18:34.279
From a mathematical perspective,

18:34.363 --> 18:40.244
anything below one in 300,000
is considered zero percent.

18:40.327 --> 18:44.665
In other words, you could say
that it will never happen.

18:44.748 --> 18:45.958
This number...

18:47.417 --> 18:49.211
It's no coincidence.

18:52.047 --> 18:53.966
This is something to brag about.

18:54.049 --> 18:57.719
Something incredibly big has noticed.

18:59.388 --> 19:01.223
Someone up above

19:01.807 --> 19:04.977
is saying this is the only time
we'll ever be able to determine

19:05.060 --> 19:07.980
who's the most powerful
in the history of Earth.

19:17.447 --> 19:19.116
<i>Incredible!</i>

19:19.199 --> 19:20.993
<i>This has never happened before.</i>

19:22.411 --> 19:26.456
<i>I can't picture even the vaguest image
or shadow of him.</i>

19:28.333 --> 19:29.376
<i>Pickle...</i>

19:29.459 --> 19:31.753
You're awesome.

19:32.421 --> 19:34.089
<i>What the heck are you?</i>

19:35.090 --> 19:37.009
<i>I can't get a full picture.</i>

19:37.759 --> 19:40.512
<i>I've seen him with my own eyes.</i>

19:40.596 --> 19:42.222
<i>It's burned into my mind.</i>

19:43.682 --> 19:46.643
<i>Those extraordinarily long,
ferocious hands.</i>

19:47.853 --> 19:51.899
<i>Those legs like sturdy springs
that power swift movement.</i>

19:52.482 --> 19:56.403
<i>Those clear eyes lit
with the flames of primordial times.</i>

19:57.362 --> 20:01.158
<i>His skin. His mouth.
Those overdeveloped canines.</i>

20:02.242 --> 20:04.328
<i>And his appearance when he fights.</i>

20:06.079 --> 20:06.997
<i>But still,</i>

20:07.873 --> 20:11.710
<i>I can't picture him facing me.</i>

20:12.211 --> 20:14.087
<i>I can't envision it.</i>

20:20.177 --> 20:21.303
Retsu.

20:23.013 --> 20:24.806
Your monster factory.

20:24.890 --> 20:27.768
Just as I expected, it's quite plain.

20:28.393 --> 20:29.603
You're practicing, huh?

20:30.979 --> 20:33.232
More like I'm getting taught a lesson.

20:34.399 --> 20:37.778
That I'm nowhere near equal to that beast.

20:39.071 --> 20:40.822
What the heck is Pickle?

20:41.740 --> 20:44.743
I don't know. Neither I nor Katsumi know.

20:44.826 --> 20:48.580
Not even the people who fought him know.

20:49.164 --> 20:52.292
Unfortunately, neither Katsumi nor I

20:53.001 --> 20:56.171
were able to trigger
Pickle's fullest potential.

21:04.763 --> 21:07.349
I can hardly stand this, Retsu.

21:09.685 --> 21:11.228
Can you believe this?

21:12.813 --> 21:17.901
I'm gonna slug it out
with an unfathomably powerful dude!

21:18.694 --> 21:21.697
We have no idea how strong he is.

21:21.780 --> 21:24.616
We don't even have any idea what he'll do!

21:24.700 --> 21:27.703
I get to fight with this dude!

21:32.499 --> 21:34.167
I see you've prepared yourself.

21:35.127 --> 21:37.254
Let's contact Tokugawa tomorrow.

21:39.381 --> 21:40.924
That's takin' it way too easy.

21:41.633 --> 21:43.385
We're not contacting him tomorrow.

21:44.344 --> 21:48.390
Tomorrow, first thing,
I'm gonna go to Pickle in person.

21:50.809 --> 21:51.893
<i>Baki...</i>

21:52.602 --> 21:55.397
<i>This may not be something
you want to hear,</i>

21:56.440 --> 21:58.150
<i>but when I looked at you now,</i>

21:59.735 --> 22:02.904
<i>I saw your father, Yujiro Hanma, in you.</i>

22:03.739 --> 22:06.616
<i>It felt as if I was speaking
to the Ogre himself.</i>

22:12.372 --> 22:15.042
I've been looking for you, Homo erectus.
